-- s 2015(c)(1)(A): the State agency may require periodic reports for the period.
@export Under section 2015(c)(1)(A), may the State agency require periodic reports for the period?
GIVEN `the length of the reporting period in months` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the length of the reporting period in months? (a number)
      `the household is a migrant or seasonal farmworker household` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household is a migrant or seasonal farmworker household?
      `all members of the household are homeless individuals` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that all members of the household are homeless individuals?
      `the household has earned income` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household has earned income?
      `all adult members of the household are elderly or disabled members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that all adult members of the household are elderly or disabled members?
      `the requirement accords with the standards prescribed by the Secretary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the requirement accords with the standards prescribed by the Secretary?
