GIVEN `the household resides on a reservation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household resides on a reservation?
      `the State agency reinstates benefits, without a new application, for a reservation household that reports within 1 month after the month in which benefits would otherwise be provided` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the State agency reinstates benefits, without a new application, for a reservation household that reports within 1 month after the month in which benefits would otherwise be provided?
      `the State agency does not delay, reduce, suspend or terminate the allotment of a household that reports within 1 month after the month in which the report is due` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the State agency does not delay, reduce, suspend or terminate the allotment of a household that reports within 1 month after the month in which the report is due?
      `on March 25, 1994 the State agency required households residing on a reservation to file periodic reports on a monthly basis` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that on March 25, 1994 the State agency required households residing on a reservation to file periodic reports on a monthly basis?
      `the certification period of those households in months` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the certification period of those households in months? (a number)
