GIVEN `the month's last day` IS A DATE @desc What is the month's last day? (a date)
      `the household is eligible to participate and has filed a timely and complete report` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household is eligible to participate and has filed a timely and complete report?
      `the Secretary has determined that a longer period of time is necessary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Secretary has determined that a longer period of time is necessary?
      `the longer period the Secretary determined, in days` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the longer period the Secretary determined, in days? (a number)
