-- s 2015(c)(2)(B): the household is to have special procedures available for filing.
@export Under section 2015(c)(2)(B), is the household to have special procedures available for filing?
GIVEN `the household is required to file a periodic report under paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household is required to file a periodic report under paragraph (1)?
      `every adult member is mentally or physically handicapped or lacks reading or writing skills to such a degree as to be unable to fill out the required forms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that every adult member is mentally or physically handicapped or lacks reading or writing skills to such a degree as to be unable to fill out the required forms?
