-- s 2015(c)(2)(D): the household is to be given prompt notice of the failure and a reasonable opportunity to cure.
@export Under section 2015(c)(2)(D), is the household to be given prompt notice of the failure and a reasonable opportunity to cure?
GIVEN `the household is required to file a periodic report under paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household is required to file a periodic report under paragraph (1)?
      `the household failed to file a report timely or completely` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household failed to file a report timely or completely?
