-- s 2015(c)(2)(C) and (E): the household is to have a reasonable period to file and a simple form with clear instructions each month.
@export Under section 2015(c)(2)(C) and (E), is the household to have a reasonable period to file and a simple form with clear instructions each month?
GIVEN `the household is required to file a periodic report under paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household is required to file a periodic report under paragraph (1)?
