GIVEN `the report is required to be filed monthly under paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the report is required to be filed monthly under paragraph (1)?
      `the subject matter is included in such monthly reports` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the subject matter is included in such monthly reports?
