@export Under section 2015(c)(4), shall the household not receive an allotment for the payment period to which the report applies?
GIVEN `the household fails to submit a periodic report required by paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household fails to submit a periodic report required by paragraph (1)?
      `paragraph (1)(C) provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that paragraph (1)(C) provides otherwise?
