    `s 2015(d)(2)(B) the person is exempt because of responsibility for the care of a dependent child or an incapacitated person` `the person is a parent or other member of a household with responsibility for the care of a dependent child` `the age of that child in years` `the age below which a child is dependent for this clause, 6 unless the State lowered it` `the person has responsibility for the care of an incapacitated person`

-- s 2015(d)(2): the State may lower the age of the dependent child.
