-- s 2015(d)(2)(B) to (F): the person is exempt from section 2015(d)(1) as the result of clause (B), (C), (D), (E), or (F).
@export Under section 2015(d)(2)(B) to (F), is the person exempt from section 2015(d)(1) as the result of clause (B), (C), (D), (E), or (F)?
