    `s 2015(d)(2)(B) to (F) the person is exempt from section 2015(d)(1) as the result of clause (B), (C), (D), (E), or (F)` (JUST `b`) (JUST `c`) (JUST `d`) (JUST `e`) (JUST `f`)

-- s 2015(d)(3): the household shall not participate while the member is on strike.
@export Under section 2015(d)(3), shall the household not participate while the member is on strike?
GIVEN `a member not exempt from the work registration requirements of paragraph (1) is on strike because of a labor dispute other than a lockout` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that a member not exempt from the work registration requirements of paragraph (1) is on strike because of a labor dispute other than a lockout?
      `the household was eligible immediately prior to the strike` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household was eligible immediately prior to the strike?
      `the household contains no member on strike and a member refuses employment at a plant or site because of a strike or lockout` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the household contains no member on strike and a member refuses employment at a plant or site because of a strike or lockout?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 2015(d)(3), shall the household not participate while the member is on strike` MEANS
    `s 2015(d)(3) the household shall not participate while the member is on strike` `a member not exempt from the work registration requirements of paragraph (1) is on strike because of a labor dispute other than a lockout` `the household was eligible immediately prior to the strike` `the household contains no member on strike and a member refuses employment at a plant or site because of a strike or lockout`

-- s 2015(d)(3): the household may receive an increased allotment as the result of a decrease in the income of the striking member.
@export Under section 2015(d)(3), may the household receive an increased allotment as the result of a decrease in the income of the striking member?
